WEBVTT

00:00:05.916 --> 00:00:07.958
-<i>Good morning.</i>
-<i>Morning.</i>

00:00:20.541 --> 00:00:21.750
Uh.

00:00:21.875 --> 00:00:23.958
Ugh.

00:00:26.083 --> 00:00:28.208
<i>The way</i>
<i>people look at me…</i>

00:00:29.916 --> 00:00:31.833
<i>I'm him, but…</i>

00:00:33.416 --> 00:00:35.708
Here you go. Uh… Oh.

00:00:36.166 --> 00:00:38.375
<i>They look at me</i>

00:00:38.458 --> 00:00:40.541
<i>in a completely different way.</i>

00:00:45.375 --> 00:00:46.666
Huh?

00:00:54.083 --> 00:00:58.166
<i>Oh, he keeps glancing</i>
<i>at me. I wonder why.</i>

00:01:00.416 --> 00:01:02.750
Excuse me.

00:01:03.125 --> 00:01:05.750
Wait. Hey, stop!

00:02:48.458 --> 00:02:50.166
Uh, excuse me.

00:03:03.333 --> 00:03:04.333
Come on.

00:03:04.416 --> 00:03:07.625
-You couldn't even jack that?
-Look, he brought a pig too.

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:11.250
Hey.

00:03:11.458 --> 00:03:13.875
Take another look
at this and maybe let this slide.

00:03:15.125 --> 00:03:18.916
But I'll get fired
if I pretend I didn't know about this.

00:03:20.208 --> 00:03:23.041
So, it's okay
if I put this on the internet then?

00:03:23.166 --> 00:03:26.708
-Oh, but, you'd said you'd be--
-Hey, that picture isn't doing anything

00:03:26.791 --> 00:03:28.458
-to keep him quiet.
-Yeah.

00:03:28.541 --> 00:03:30.250
Let's just take another one.

00:03:32.208 --> 00:03:33.083
Shall we?

00:03:33.166 --> 00:03:34.916
So, what picture should we take?

00:03:35.416 --> 00:03:39.916
Hmm. Oh, hey. Why don't we make
these losers fight each other?

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:41.250
What?

00:03:41.333 --> 00:03:42.791
That sounds fun. Good idea.

00:03:42.916 --> 00:03:45.791
Come, fight each other
and we'll see who wins.

00:03:45.916 --> 00:03:47.416
Huh, Park Ji-ho?

00:03:49.583 --> 00:03:51.333
Jeez.

00:03:51.541 --> 00:03:53.833
Sorry.

00:04:00.583 --> 00:04:04.500
-He's terrible at this.
-All right. I'll be nice.

00:04:04.833 --> 00:04:06.750
Park Ji-ho, if you win,
I'll let you graduate

00:04:06.833 --> 00:04:08.875
-from being an errand boy.
-Stop that right now.

00:04:10.416 --> 00:04:11.708
-Huh?
-Huh?

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:14.166
Huh?

00:04:14.416 --> 00:04:16.958
Basco!

00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:21.375
Huh? Basco?

00:04:24.791 --> 00:04:27.000
You boys are the bad guys here?

00:04:27.125 --> 00:04:30.958
I… I'm sorry, just let me go
this one time.

00:04:35.708 --> 00:04:38.625
<i>Wow, he's amazingly strong.</i>

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:41.500
Shut up and go home.

00:04:45.875 --> 00:04:48.875
Uh…

00:04:54.750 --> 00:04:57.250
And I think you two should,
uh, work out or something.

00:04:57.333 --> 00:05:00.833
-Uh, yeah, thank you.
-Hmm? What did you say, kiddo?

00:05:01.041 --> 00:05:03.083
Oh, uh, thank you.

00:05:03.250 --> 00:05:05.958
-Hmm? What?
-Uh, your earbuds.

00:05:06.791 --> 00:05:10.333
-Oh, right.
-Thank you, Basco.

00:05:10.541 --> 00:05:12.500
Do I know you? We at the same school?

00:05:12.791 --> 00:05:15.791
Yeah. I'm Park Ji-ho.
Tenth grade. Fashion class.

00:05:15.958 --> 00:05:19.333
Oh, wait, you're in Fashion classes too?
The same class?

00:05:19.458 --> 00:05:22.291
-The same class?
-What I mean is that I, uh--

00:05:22.375 --> 00:05:24.416
Is that the class
with the new student?

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:25.583
Yeah, it is.

00:05:26.041 --> 00:05:27.541
<i>They're talking about me.</i>

00:05:27.875 --> 00:05:31.916
Be sure to let him know,
don't go messing around.

00:05:33.833 --> 00:05:34.833
Uh, what?

00:05:36.333 --> 00:05:39.291
<i>Why is he crying all of a sudden?</i>

00:05:45.750 --> 00:05:47.333
JAEWON HIGH SCHOOL

00:05:47.541 --> 00:05:50.750
I see that Park Ji-ho's absent
today, and let's see…

00:05:51.166 --> 00:05:53.583
Mm, okay, morning assembly's over.

00:05:54.458 --> 00:05:56.458
<i>I wonder if something happened.</i>

00:06:00.958 --> 00:06:03.750
Oh, right. Uh, whoever
is on cleaning duty, please tidy up

00:06:03.833 --> 00:06:05.125
-after class.
-Yes, sir.

00:06:05.208 --> 00:06:07.125
<i>Oh, Basco from Architecture class?</i>

00:06:07.291 --> 00:06:09.666
-What about him?
-Huh? Oh, I…

00:06:09.875 --> 00:06:12.833
-I was just curious.
-Well, his real name is Lee Eun-tae.

00:06:12.958 --> 00:06:15.291
He assembled the Burn Knuckle gang
in the Architecture class

00:06:15.416 --> 00:06:17.500
-which he's the leader of.
-Leader?

00:06:17.666 --> 00:06:20.291
He's nice to the weak,
but hates show-offs.

00:06:20.416 --> 00:06:22.875
A brawny idiot. That's who Basco is.

00:06:22.958 --> 00:06:24.500
What are you doing?

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:27.208
You're interrupting
my super romantic lunch with Hyeong-seok.

00:06:27.416 --> 00:06:29.083
Hey, don't be like that.

00:06:29.208 --> 00:06:31.708
We want to be friends
with Hyeong-seok too.

00:06:31.791 --> 00:06:33.333
-Mm-hmm.
-Huh? Uh.

00:06:34.333 --> 00:06:35.208
-Hey.
-Huh?

00:06:35.291 --> 00:06:36.291
Look.

00:06:38.166 --> 00:06:39.750
Burn Knuckle gang.

00:06:43.875 --> 00:06:46.125
Huh? It's Basco.

00:06:46.583 --> 00:06:48.083
Huh?

00:06:50.833 --> 00:06:52.416
-Huh?
-Hmm.

00:06:55.208 --> 00:06:56.916
Hey, Basco.

00:06:57.291 --> 00:06:59.125
-You done eating, are you?
-Let's hurry out.

00:07:01.458 --> 00:07:03.916
-Yesterday.
-Yesterday?

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:07.000
<i>Oh, right,</i>
<i>that wasn't me.</i>

00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:10.916
Are you trying to avenge
those friends of yours from yesterday?

00:07:11.125 --> 00:07:14.041
-Huh?
-I knew you were a bad guy.

00:07:14.291 --> 00:07:15.416
There he goes.

00:07:16.125 --> 00:07:18.583
No one ever taught you
a lesson, did they?

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:20.333
Don't you go messing around

00:07:20.458 --> 00:07:23.458
just because you've got
a pretty face and a knack for fighting.

00:07:30.833 --> 00:07:33.458
Yeah, Basco!
The shoulder knuckle grab.

00:07:33.875 --> 00:07:36.166
Wait, stop that.
What are you doing? Don't!

00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:39.708
Don't get yourself hurt.
No one in the world can stop him now.

00:07:40.208 --> 00:07:42.541
Look!
Look, they're fighting.

00:07:42.625 --> 00:07:44.541
Hmm?

00:07:45.125 --> 00:07:47.416
This is bad!
Should I take a video as evidence?

00:07:47.666 --> 00:07:50.041
<i>What?</i>

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:57.583
Basco's too strong,
no one can escape his grasp.

00:07:58.333 --> 00:08:02.041
I'm sorry if I offended you.

00:08:04.125 --> 00:08:07.416
I only said that because you looked like…

00:08:07.708 --> 00:08:09.625
…someone I met yesterday.

00:08:11.708 --> 00:08:13.958
Huh? He escaped the knuckle?

00:08:14.666 --> 00:08:18.375
Oh, no way. He's doing it one handed.

00:08:21.375 --> 00:08:25.166
I must have confused you
with somebody else.

00:08:37.916 --> 00:08:40.416
Ah, yeah, of course.
Looks like you got him mixed up

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:41.541
with someone else.

00:08:42.083 --> 00:08:43.958
Uh, yeah, I'm sorry.

00:08:44.166 --> 00:08:47.041
It's okay, that happens.
Am I right, Basco?

00:08:48.625 --> 00:08:50.375
And, uh, lunch break's going
to be over soon.

00:08:50.541 --> 00:08:53.416
So, come on, let's eat.
Let's go, Basco.

00:09:00.458 --> 00:09:03.250
Why did you stop him, Park Beom-jae?

00:09:03.416 --> 00:09:04.833
That little punk was annoying.

00:09:05.083 --> 00:09:08.666
-You should've let Basco knock him out.
-No, it's not that.

00:09:09.625 --> 00:09:11.583
Basco's the one
who would've been knocked out.

00:09:15.041 --> 00:09:17.458
You really are something else!

00:09:17.750 --> 00:09:21.250
-Basco is freakishly strong.
-Oh, I… I… I was just…

00:09:22.083 --> 00:09:23.708
<i>But I didn't fight him.</i>

00:09:24.041 --> 00:09:25.500
-Huh?
-Hyeong-seok,

00:09:25.583 --> 00:09:27.416
-why don't we be friends?
-Uh…

00:09:27.583 --> 00:09:31.041
-Hmm. What are you up to?
-I'm not up to anything, 'kay?

00:09:31.208 --> 00:09:35.375
Yeah, so, why don't we hang out?
That way we can all get closer.

00:09:35.916 --> 00:09:38.541
We're friends now.
Let's have some fun.

00:09:39.875 --> 00:09:40.750
Some fun?

00:09:45.333 --> 00:09:46.541
With my friends?

00:09:47.333 --> 00:09:51.291
-Yeah, we're friends now.
-What a good idea!

00:09:51.708 --> 00:09:54.916
-I wasn't asking you to join.
-So, what is it then?

00:09:55.125 --> 00:09:56.166
-Huh?
-Don't you want to?

00:09:56.250 --> 00:09:58.291
No, I'd love that, truly.

00:09:58.916 --> 00:10:03.833
<i>How long have I waited for a day</i>
<i>like this, hanging out with friends?</i>

00:10:06.416 --> 00:10:07.958
-Let's hang out…
-Huh?

00:10:08.083 --> 00:10:10.708
…Hyeong-seok, and have some fun.

00:10:10.791 --> 00:10:12.500
Hyeong-seok.

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:15.458
-Hyeong-seok.
-Hyeong-seok.

00:10:15.583 --> 00:10:16.958
Hyeong-seok.

00:10:22.791 --> 00:10:24.166
Huh?

00:10:24.625 --> 00:10:27.500
JEONGOL DELICACY

00:10:27.791 --> 00:10:29.875
-Oh, gosh.
-Oh, please.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:32.333
-Hyeong-seok is so my type.
-You say that

00:10:32.416 --> 00:10:33.791
-about everyone.
-What is this?

00:10:33.875 --> 00:10:35.666
What do you mean
I'm moving in on him?

00:10:35.750 --> 00:10:37.958
-He does like me!
-You say everyone

00:10:38.083 --> 00:10:40.041
-likes you. Oh, just stop.
-Oh, Hyeong-seok.

00:10:40.125 --> 00:10:42.125
-Good to see ya.
-Any trouble finding us?

00:10:42.250 --> 00:10:44.666
-Hey take a seat.
-Hmm. Oh, uh…

00:10:44.791 --> 00:10:47.375
<i>This is not what I thought it would be.</i>

00:10:47.791 --> 00:10:51.250
-Come sit down, Hyeong-seok.
-You're ready to get drunk?

00:10:56.291 --> 00:10:59.541
Hyeong-seok,
you look great out of your uniform too.

00:10:59.625 --> 00:11:00.500
Oh, thank you.

00:11:00.875 --> 00:11:04.458
It's just a plain top,
but it looks great on your frame.

00:11:04.875 --> 00:11:06.250
It's a bit big for you, though.

00:11:06.500 --> 00:11:09.291
Oh, it… Well, it's my friend's.

00:11:09.458 --> 00:11:12.958
-Your friend must be pretty big then, huh?
-Hmm?

00:11:13.125 --> 00:11:15.416
Huh?

00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:17.875
-<i>Lee Jin-seong?</i>
-Hey, bro.

00:11:18.041 --> 00:11:19.541
We were just about to get started.

00:11:24.708 --> 00:11:26.916
-What are you doing here?
-Uh…

00:11:27.625 --> 00:11:30.541
-Hey, don't be like that.
-It's a surprise, a surprise!

00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:33.750
We've got your favorite,
so loosen up, huh?

00:11:35.250 --> 00:11:36.458
Here.

00:11:39.041 --> 00:11:40.041
Hyeong-seok, you too.

00:11:40.166 --> 00:11:41.791
-Here.
-Oh, uh, no, thanks.

00:11:41.916 --> 00:11:45.333
-Drinking isn't my thing.
-Aw, what a crock of bullshit.

00:11:45.625 --> 00:11:48.125
Oh, that's all right.
I'm a lightweight too.

00:11:50.458 --> 00:11:52.166
Hyeong-seok,
you haven't had a drink,

00:11:52.291 --> 00:11:55.000
but your face is red.

00:11:57.166 --> 00:11:59.541
-<i>This is so awkward.</i>
-Hyeong-seok,

00:11:59.833 --> 00:12:01.166
it's okay, just drink.

00:12:01.291 --> 00:12:04.083
-We'll get you home if you pass out.
-Right, where do you live?

00:12:04.500 --> 00:12:08.333
-I just live on my own now.
-Jackpot.

00:12:08.666 --> 00:12:10.208
Why are you all flustered?

00:12:10.333 --> 00:12:13.500
You live by yourself?
You're in a class of your own!

00:12:13.625 --> 00:12:16.125
-Oh, we could use it as our hideout.
-Sounds great.

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:17.833
-Oh, you can't.
-Huh?

00:12:17.916 --> 00:12:19.500
-I live with my friend, so--
-Your friend?

00:12:19.583 --> 00:12:21.833
-Oh, who lent you the top?
-Huh? Right.

00:12:22.166 --> 00:12:25.875
-Is he in high school?
-Oh, it's, uh, really, actually…

00:12:27.083 --> 00:12:28.791
He dropped out of school already.

00:12:29.291 --> 00:12:31.000
He works at night
and sleeps during the day.

00:12:31.083 --> 00:12:32.666
So, I can't let you use it as a hideout.

00:12:32.833 --> 00:12:35.458
He dropped out of school
and works at night?

00:12:37.166 --> 00:12:39.041
<i>That's the sort of guy he lives with?</i>

00:12:39.125 --> 00:12:41.000
<i>He's more dangerous than we thought.</i>

00:12:43.791 --> 00:12:45.625
Hey, hey, take it easy.

00:12:46.041 --> 00:12:48.458
Yeah, yeah. Fill it up.

00:12:50.375 --> 00:12:53.333
That reminds me, why isn't Mi-jin here?

00:12:53.625 --> 00:12:55.541
Mi-jin doesn't like hanging out like this.

00:12:55.708 --> 00:12:57.666
Yeah, that's right.
She hates us fighting.

00:12:57.750 --> 00:12:59.500
She's innocent, unlike Ha-neul.

00:12:59.583 --> 00:13:01.375
What?

00:13:01.583 --> 00:13:04.166
How did you two start dating then?

00:13:04.583 --> 00:13:05.458
Huh?

00:13:05.791 --> 00:13:08.125
Oh,
it's just you two seem pretty different

00:13:08.208 --> 00:13:10.541
and I was wondering
how you two got together.

00:13:10.625 --> 00:13:12.375
They aren't actually dating.

00:13:13.458 --> 00:13:15.416
He told her he liked her
and they went on a date.

00:13:15.666 --> 00:13:17.666
Oh, really? Sorry.

00:13:17.958 --> 00:13:20.833
-I… I assumed you guys were together.
-What?

00:13:21.083 --> 00:13:23.208
You two looked so great together.

00:13:23.500 --> 00:13:25.250
You're…

00:13:25.750 --> 00:13:27.166
Huh?

00:13:27.541 --> 00:13:28.791
…really…

00:13:29.041 --> 00:13:31.958
…a super great guy, aren't you?

00:13:32.375 --> 00:13:34.000
-What the…
-Wait, is he, uh…

00:13:36.291 --> 00:13:39.500
-Come on, drink up, drink.
-I told you I… I can't drink.

00:13:39.791 --> 00:13:43.041
And I'm sorry
about punching you yesterday.

00:13:43.500 --> 00:13:47.291
-I really didn't mean to.
-Ah, I'm a boxer, man.

00:13:47.583 --> 00:13:49.041
No grudges.

00:13:49.208 --> 00:13:52.125
If you want to apologize,
take a drink.

00:13:52.208 --> 00:13:55.458
Well, at least they made up.
The power of alcohol.

00:13:55.916 --> 00:13:57.375
Well, that was a relief.

00:13:57.875 --> 00:14:01.000
Huh? What are you talking about, man?
Hmm?

00:14:01.208 --> 00:14:03.333
Oh, yesterday, we told Park Ji-ho

00:14:03.416 --> 00:14:06.166
to steal a cell phone charger
and Basco interfered.

00:14:06.333 --> 00:14:07.458
Basco?

00:14:07.541 --> 00:14:09.166
We need someone strong…

00:14:09.250 --> 00:14:11.416
…so those guys will know
not to mess with us.

00:14:11.500 --> 00:14:14.208
Nothing to fear with Jin-seong
and Hyeong-seok with us.

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:19.041
Yeah, that's right! That's right.
Nothing to be scared of.

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:24.166
This is all Park Ji-ho's fault.

00:14:24.666 --> 00:14:29.416
-If that little jerk didn't get caught.
-Damn, he's such a pathetic bastard.

00:14:31.833 --> 00:14:33.875
Oh, hey.

00:14:34.125 --> 00:14:35.500
I took a funny video yesterday.

00:14:35.583 --> 00:14:38.833
-Huh? Video of what?
-A real loser's brawl.

00:14:41.916 --> 00:14:43.833
I've got a picture too.

00:14:43.958 --> 00:14:45.041
What picture?

00:14:45.125 --> 00:14:47.000
Wanna see?

00:14:47.125 --> 00:14:48.833
This is funny stuff.

00:14:51.958 --> 00:14:53.750
Crushed the phone with one hand.

00:14:54.500 --> 00:14:55.541
There's no way.

00:14:57.791 --> 00:15:00.000
You shouldn't be taking
such weird pictures.

00:15:00.083 --> 00:15:01.416
Whoa.

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:03.458
That was… that was my phone.

00:15:03.541 --> 00:15:06.708
-Hyeong-seok, are you okay?
-Huh?

00:15:07.541 --> 00:15:13.083
Oh, my eyelids feel so heavy.

00:15:18.625 --> 00:15:19.583
<i>I fell asleep.</i>

00:15:19.708 --> 00:15:22.083
I have to get back
to sleep right now.

00:15:28.250 --> 00:15:34.166
Hyeong-seok,
please forgive me, just this once.

00:15:35.958 --> 00:15:37.916
Oh, Lee Tae-seong? Huh?

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:41.583
Oh, hi, honey. Please come.
Have some ramen.

00:15:41.666 --> 00:15:43.208
I put 100 eggs in it.

00:15:43.541 --> 00:15:45.958
Oh! Huh? Mom?

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:47.875
What's going on?

00:15:51.416 --> 00:15:53.750
It was a dream.

00:15:54.125 --> 00:15:56.833
Whoa. I didn't change bodies.

00:16:00.166 --> 00:16:02.375
<i>That body didn't disappear, did it?</i>

00:16:03.916 --> 00:16:06.500
No, Hyeong-seok!

00:16:07.208 --> 00:16:10.083
<i>Oh, come on!</i>
<i>Hurry up, you pig!</i>

00:16:11.333 --> 00:16:12.916
We should give him some cold water.

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:15.333
How can you make
a sleeping person drink water?

00:16:15.416 --> 00:16:17.458
You shouldn't have forced him
to drink in the first place.

00:16:17.541 --> 00:16:21.000
-What? Not our fault.
-Park Hyeong-seok, wake up.

00:16:21.708 --> 00:16:23.416
He's completely out of it.

00:16:26.375 --> 00:16:28.625
Hmm?

00:16:32.750 --> 00:16:34.291
Wait a second.

00:16:34.875 --> 00:16:36.416
You're that pig
from the convenience store.

00:16:38.000 --> 00:16:40.166
<i>-Oh, no.</i>
-What's with him?

00:16:46.541 --> 00:16:49.750
-Hyeong-seok.
-Hyeong-seok.

00:16:53.416 --> 00:16:55.208
Nice to see you again, pig.

00:16:58.000 --> 00:17:00.875
Huh? Why are you here?

00:17:01.375 --> 00:17:03.708
I, uh, I'm here to pick up my friend.

00:17:03.958 --> 00:17:06.458
-Your friend?
-Yeah. Hyeong-seok.

00:17:06.875 --> 00:17:08.041
-Huh?
-What?

00:17:08.125 --> 00:17:09.458
Huh? Don't lie to us.

00:17:09.625 --> 00:17:12.625
-You're Hyeong-seok's friend?
-I… It's true.

00:17:12.833 --> 00:17:15.625
Oh, are you the friend he lives with then?

00:17:15.875 --> 00:17:20.833
Oh, I, um, his roommate told me
that I have to come down here and get him.

00:17:23.166 --> 00:17:26.583
<i>The thug must have told him to do it.</i>

00:17:27.125 --> 00:17:29.791
Oh, poor piggy, yeah.

00:17:30.375 --> 00:17:35.125
Are you still running errands
at this late hour? Oh, you.

00:17:40.875 --> 00:17:43.791
Huh? Man, I haven't played
with one of these in a while.

00:17:43.875 --> 00:17:45.708
-Hey.
-I used to play

00:17:45.791 --> 00:17:46.791
with this all the time.

00:17:48.125 --> 00:17:50.333
-Have any money?
-Huh? Yeah.

00:17:54.791 --> 00:17:57.791
-Pig, watch me.
-Mm.

00:17:58.000 --> 00:18:00.625
Keep your arm right next
to your cheek to guard yourself,

00:18:01.041 --> 00:18:03.250
feet shoulders-width apart,
arms parallel with each other,

00:18:03.333 --> 00:18:05.416
and your hips should be
the center of balance.

00:18:05.791 --> 00:18:09.208
-This is the basic stance.
-Huh? Okay.

00:18:09.291 --> 00:18:12.250
Now, you take a step forward
and your weight should shift

00:18:12.333 --> 00:18:14.833
from your hips,
to your shoulders, to your fists.

00:18:14.916 --> 00:18:17.583
-That is a straight.
-Uh?

00:18:18.500 --> 00:18:21.625
Um, why are you teaching me
a boxing stance?

00:18:24.000 --> 00:18:26.041
Whoa, that's amazing.

00:18:26.291 --> 00:18:27.541
Wow, a new record.

00:18:28.208 --> 00:18:33.041
-You really have that special something.
-Well, none of it matters, if they dodge.

00:18:38.708 --> 00:18:42.208
Hey, piggy, make sure you don't get
yourself punched anymore, all right?

00:18:46.583 --> 00:18:49.541
That's what you get
for throwing a punch when you get drunk.

00:18:50.208 --> 00:18:51.333
Let's go home.

00:18:51.708 --> 00:18:54.208
The pig says he'll take Hyeong-seok home.

00:18:54.791 --> 00:18:57.208
I've got curfew too.

00:18:58.041 --> 00:19:01.291
-Oh… Mm.
-Hmm? Hmm.

00:19:07.291 --> 00:19:10.833
<i>Keep your arm right</i>
<i>by your cheek, feet shoulder-width apart,</i>

00:19:10.916 --> 00:19:13.083
<i>arms parallel with each other,</i>
<i>your hips should be</i>

00:19:13.166 --> 00:19:14.666
<i>the center of balance.</i>

00:19:14.833 --> 00:19:17.791
<i>Step forward and shift your weight</i>
<i>from your hips to your shoulders.</i>

00:19:17.875 --> 00:19:19.500
<i>Hold your fists straight.</i>

00:19:31.625 --> 00:19:34.541
Hmm.

00:19:43.750 --> 00:19:46.500
Like this.
Protect the wrist if you can.

00:19:47.291 --> 00:19:49.458
Now, straighten your back like this.
See what I mean?

00:19:49.541 --> 00:19:51.083
What is it?

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:52.375
Huh?

00:19:58.750 --> 00:20:00.000
Yeah!

00:20:00.291 --> 00:20:02.750
-That's Basco for you.
-Nice, with just one punch.

00:20:02.916 --> 00:20:06.541
-So awesome.
-Whoa, that was sick.

00:20:06.916 --> 00:20:10.458
Nice. It's a new record.
Basco, can I use the bonus?

00:20:10.625 --> 00:20:14.541
Huh! I would have got over a thousand,
if only my shoulder wasn't still tender.

00:20:14.625 --> 00:20:16.041
Oh Yi-ra, you've become

00:20:16.166 --> 00:20:18.458
quite the big talker
since I last met you, huh?

00:20:18.666 --> 00:20:21.333
It's true. I fought
the Biz Ed guys last week,

00:20:21.416 --> 00:20:23.541
three on one.

00:20:23.666 --> 00:20:25.000
Wha-- I… I swear.

00:20:30.083 --> 00:20:32.625
Gosh, I can't believe
how handsome he is!

00:20:32.791 --> 00:20:35.000
It's like he walked off
the pages of a manga.

00:20:35.083 --> 00:20:37.333
-Hyeong-seok.
-He is so my type.

00:20:37.458 --> 00:20:39.791
-So, how are you feeling today?
-Oh, I'm fine.

00:20:40.833 --> 00:20:43.250
<i>I waited until the alcohol wore off.</i>

00:20:45.791 --> 00:20:48.291
<i>Then I was able</i>
<i>to wake up in this body.</i>

00:20:52.291 --> 00:20:54.500
-Hey, sit here.
-Oh, thanks.

00:20:54.583 --> 00:20:57.041
-God, I'm starving.
-Huh? Ji-ho?

00:20:57.333 --> 00:20:59.250
Uh, ah!

00:20:59.416 --> 00:21:01.041
Why didn't you come to school yesterday?

00:21:01.125 --> 00:21:03.291
I couldn't wake up yesterday morning.

00:21:03.375 --> 00:21:06.708
The guys made me go out the night before,
so I didn't get any sleep.

00:21:07.000 --> 00:21:08.208
And they

00:21:08.583 --> 00:21:11.750
reminded me that I can't miss any school
'cause I have to do their errands.

00:21:11.833 --> 00:21:13.458
I'm glad though.

00:21:13.625 --> 00:21:15.625
I was worried.

00:21:15.708 --> 00:21:16.625
Worried?

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:18.916
<i>-Why is he acting so friendly?</i>
-Hey,

00:21:19.041 --> 00:21:20.666
-isn't that Park Ji-ho?
-Huh?

00:21:20.791 --> 00:21:21.666
Who's Park Ji-ho?

00:21:21.750 --> 00:21:24.166
You… you know, Ji-ho.
He's… he's in our Fashion class.

00:21:24.250 --> 00:21:25.416
Oh, that loser?

00:21:25.541 --> 00:21:27.458
<i>Why is Hyeong-seok talking to him?</i>

00:21:27.541 --> 00:21:29.875
If it's okay with you,
can we eat together?

00:21:34.250 --> 00:21:35.458
Whoa.

00:21:41.750 --> 00:21:44.166
-What's with Park Ji-ho?
-How do those guys know each other?

00:21:44.291 --> 00:21:46.125
Those two look so weird together.

00:22:14.333 --> 00:22:16.958
Huh? Uh… uh, Hyeong-seok.

00:22:17.791 --> 00:22:21.000
Why aren't you at school?
